  "$comment_focus": "`focus` is what the crop must not throw away. It is not decoration: it goes into the generation brief, it is printed on the review sheet next to every candidate, and it is the sentence a reviewer checks a crop against. `mobile` is an art-directed second crop for narrow screens — declared only where a wide role would otherwise become a letterbox slit on a phone."
